{
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "intro",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": -300,
      "width": 1400,
      "height": 240,
      "text": "# Revised Pro prompts and claims\n\nKeep live monitoring, postcard publishing AND claim processing in Pro. Replace the aircraft upsell with Live updates off in trip details; allow permanent home dismissal. Show one large introduction per account, then compact entries even on new trips. No unsolicited near-departure nudge.\n\nOpen design/free-and-pro/canvas.html. Revised prompts, Before take-off and Claims & Pro are the latest proposal. All changes are canvas-only."
    },
    {
      "id": "label-first",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 400,
      "height": 120,
      "text": "## First relevant visit\n\nLarge introduction once per account; consume after exposure/visit."
    },
    {
      "id": "screen-first",
      "type": "file",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 150,
      "width": 400,
      "height": 880,
      "file": "design/free-and-pro/previews/revised-first.png"
    },
    {
      "id": "label-return",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 480,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 400,
      "height": 120,
      "text": "## Three trips, one status row\n\nOne home entry with ×. Closing hides it on later visits and trips; Pro stays in trip details."
    },
    {
      "id": "screen-return",
      "type": "file",
      "x": 480,
      "y": 150,
      "width": 400,
      "height": 880,
      "file": "design/free-and-pro/previews/revised-return.png"
    },
    {
      "id": "label-inbound",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 960,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 400,
      "height": 120,
      "text": "## Open Paris, keep Paris\n\nLive updates off → a shorter Pro offer for Paris. The reminder date appears in the next step."
    },
    {
      "id": "screen-inbound",
      "type": "file",
      "x": 960,
      "y": 150,
      "width": 400,
      "height": 880,
      "file": "design/free-and-pro/previews/revised-inbound.png"
    },
    {
      "id": "claim-label-check",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 3680,
      "width": 400,
      "height": 120,
      "text": "## Manual eligibility: recommended free\n\nAutomatic possible-claim alerts are Pro. The HTML also previews all checks gated."
    },
    {
      "id": "claim-check",
      "type": "file",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 3830,
      "width": 400,
      "height": 880,
      "file": "design/free-and-pro/previews/claim-check.png"
    },
    {
      "id": "claim-label-gate",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 480,
      "y": 3680,
      "width": 400,
      "height": 120,
      "text": "## Claim preparation: Pro\n\nKeep any known verdict; upgrade to prepare the claim."
    },
    {
      "id": "claim-gate",
      "type": "file",
      "x": 480,
      "y": 3830,
      "width": 400,
      "height": 880,
      "file": "design/free-and-pro/previews/claim-gate.png"
    },
    {
      "id": "claim-label-active",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 960,
      "y": 3680,
      "width": 400,
      "height": 120,
      "text": "## Return to the claim after purchase\n\nReview the same flight and details. No automatic letter sending."
    },
    {
      "id": "claim-active",
      "type": "file",
      "x": 960,
      "y": 3830,
      "width": 400,
      "height": 880,
      "file": "design/free-and-pro/previews/claim-active.png"
    },
    {
      "id": "home-closed-label",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1440,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 400,
      "height": 120,
      "text": "## After closing on home\n\nTrips remain. The home card stays hidden across visits and future trips; the same status card remains inside trip details."
    },
    {
      "id": "home-closed",
      "type": "file",
      "x": 1440,
      "y": 150,
      "width": 400,
      "height": 880,
      "file": "design/free-and-pro/previews/home-card-dismissed.png"
    },
    {
      "id": "timing-intro",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 1110,
      "width": 1400,
      "height": 180,
      "text": "# After a Pro tap: choose the timing\n\nFlights defaults to the next owned trip. Details retain the opened trip. Pro is account-wide; reminders are trip-specific. The requested offer includes a single Remind me 2 days before this trip button, with extra separation before Continue free. Open canvas.html → Before take-off to try the interaction."
    },
    {
      "id": "timing-label-offer",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 1350,
      "width": 400,
      "height": 120,
      "text": "## 1 · Pro offer\n\nThree short benefits and one reminder button. Continue free is separated by 24px; reminder details follow on the next step."
    },
    {
      "id": "timing-offer",
      "type": "file",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 1500,
      "width": 400,
      "height": 880,
      "file": "design/free-and-pro/previews/timing-offer.png"
    },
    {
      "id": "timing-label-confirm",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 480,
      "y": 1350,
      "width": 400,
      "height": 120,
      "text": "## 2 · Confirm reminder\n\nSelected trip, exact date and departure-local time. No purchase."
    },
    {
      "id": "timing-confirm",
      "type": "file",
      "x": 480,
      "y": 1500,
      "width": 400,
      "height": 880,
      "file": "design/free-and-pro/previews/timing-confirm.png"
    },
    {
      "id": "timing-label-saved",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 960,
      "y": 1350,
      "width": 400,
      "height": 120,
      "text": "## 3 · Back to all trips\n\nA small label on the chosen trip; a dismissed home status stays hidden."
    },
    {
      "id": "timing-saved",
      "type": "file",
      "x": 960,
      "y": 1500,
      "width": 400,
      "height": 880,
      "file": "design/free-and-pro/previews/timing-saved.png"
    },
    {
      "id": "timing-label-due",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 2510,
      "width": 400,
      "height": 120,
      "text": "## 4 · Requested reminder arrives\n\nUse home only while its card remains visible. A requested reminder stays accessible in the trip."
    },
    {
      "id": "timing-due",
      "type": "file",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 2660,
      "width": 400,
      "height": 880,
      "file": "design/free-and-pro/previews/timing-due.png"
    },
    {
      "id": "timing-label-plans",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 480,
      "y": 2510,
      "width": 400,
      "height": 120,
      "text": "## Alternative · See plans now\n\nMonthly first, account-wide access, recurring terms. Timing remains reachable."
    },
    {
      "id": "timing-plans",
      "type": "file",
      "x": 480,
      "y": 2660,
      "width": 400,
      "height": 880,
      "file": "design/free-and-pro/previews/timing-plans.png"
    },
    {
      "id": "timing-label-active",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 960,
      "y": 2510,
      "width": 400,
      "height": 120,
      "text": "## After purchase · Pro active\n\nCancel acquisition reminders. Each flight starts monitoring in its supported window."
    },
    {
      "id": "timing-active",
      "type": "file",
      "x": 960,
      "y": 2660,
      "width": 400,
      "height": 880,
      "file": "design/free-and-pro/previews/timing-active.png"
    }
